# Core Architecture

Dependency direction:

```text
@dndgem/core <- @dndgem/dom <- @dndgem/react
```

- `@dndgem/core` must not depend on DOM, HTMLElement, CSS, window, document, ResizeObserver, React, dnd-kit, or AI SDKs.
- No reverse imports.
- No private cross-package source imports; use public package exports only.
- Do not create placeholder packages for vue/angular/svelte/flutter/ai/enterprise/cloud.
